{"id":"615872471","kind":"article","title":"填空卡可用于创建典型的 N 面卡片","author":"Andy Matuschak","original_authors":["Andy Matuschak"],"original_source_urls":["https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zgpjhmJfdVNcrGroeKW1VQ92YLGCftpyVPc"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2023-03-21","updated":"2023-05-20","votes":6,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":389,"keywords":["间隔重复","填空卡","问答卡","助记媒介"],"summary":"作者指出，问答抽认卡可视为填空卡的特例：把回答内容设为空缺，就能用填空卡构造问答卡；他称自己正在个人助记媒介中实践这一做法。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/615872471","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":2,"title":"链接至本文（已汉化）"},{"id":"sec-2","level":2,"title":"声明"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"KjnW1fSR\">典型的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>会将填空卡和问答卡用不同的方式展示，但有趣的是，你可以将典型抽认卡（问答卡）视为填空卡的特例。</p><p data-pid=\"VPQ59nu7\">也就是说，可以用填空卡来构造问答卡，把回答的内容挖空即可。</p><p data-pid=\"8BNrYhhm\">我正在本人的实践中利用这种观察，见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4mAF1uBV96r72e4NjLcDaujEyTPGiUQJEj8C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">我的个人助记媒介实现</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>； <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zzqNiAYNTSENmBcCV4zkNBrVKWoqXqFmNFL\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Log：个人助记媒介</a> 。例子如下图：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-d320f831dde65f726ad4b54ee7d1cafe\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-d320f831dde65f726ad4b54ee7d1cafe_r.jpg\" width=\"886\"/></figure><h2 id=\"sec-1\">链接至本文（已汉化）</h2><ul><li data-pid=\"U8c0Mg9M\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"399548149\" href=\"#/post/399548149\">在间隔重复记忆系统中，填空卡似乎比问答卡产生更少的理解</a></li><li data-pid=\"y_a-CK3-\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"630862056\" href=\"#/post/630862056\">语言模型可以基于填空卡生成高质量的问答卡</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"sec-2\">声明</h2><p data-pid=\"a1kSLiu9\">此内容发布由 Andy Matuschak 许可。未经允许，不得转载或修改。保留所有权利。</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"LRDfZst9\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 <span class=\"nolink\">偶然奇怪~ ☆</span>、校对 Shom<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zgpjhmJfdVNcrGroeKW1VQ92YLGCftpyVPc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cloze deletionscan be used to create typical N-sided flashcards (andymatuschak.org)</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system） <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 我的个人助记媒介实现 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"589049043\" href=\"#/post/589049043\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"604596550","title":"计划本身不算什么，计划过程才是关键","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"620583957","title":"记忆系统与解题练习","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":82,"minutes":13,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 间隔重复 & 注意力管理"},{"id":"630862056","title":"GPT-3 能够将填空卡转换为问答卡","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":12,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"399548149","title":"在间隔重复记忆系统中，填空卡似乎比问答卡产生更少的理解","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":24,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"589049043","title":"我的个人助记媒介实现","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":5,"minutes":3,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"720345834","title":"你应该记住什么？间隔重复你的生活","author":"Jose Luis Ricon","votes":65,"minutes":4,"reason":"跨作者共鸣「间隔重复」· Jose Luis Ricon"}],"rec_answers":[]}